data: {"text":"1. That the Applicant has been falsely implicated in FIR No. 124/2026 dated 15.03.2026, registered at Police Station Kotwali, under"}

data: {"text":" Sections 303 and 351 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023, and seeks"}

data: {"text":" regular bail from this Hon'ble Court as the matter involves both bailable and non-bailable offences"}

data: {"text":".\n\n2. That the Applicant submits that he has been falsely implicated in the aforesaid FIR due to a long"}

data: {"text":"-standing land dispute with the Complainant. The instant case is nothing but a deliberate attempt"}

data: {"text":" by the Complainant to settle scores and harass the Applicant by misusing the"}

data: {"text":" process of law.\n\n3. That the Applicant categorically denies the allegations levelled against him and submits that he was"}

data: {"text":" not present at the time of the alleged incident. The Applicant has credible witnesses who can establish his alibi and prove his innocence beyond any shadow"}

data: {"text":" of doubt.\n\n4. That the Applicant was arrested on 16.03.2026 and has been languishing in judicial custody since then without any justifiable reason. The continued"}

data: {"text":" detention of the Applicant is violative of his fundamental right to liberty guaranteed under Article 21 of the Constitution of India.\n\n5. That the Applicant is a law-abiding citizen with no previous"}

data: {"text":" criminal antecedents and has never been involved in any criminal activity whatsoever. He is a respectable member of society and"}

data: {"text":" poses no threat to the peace and tranquility of the area.\n\n6. That the Applicant has deep roots in the community and has no"}

data: {"text":" intention or inclination to flee from justice or abscond. He is ready and"}

data: {"text":" willing to cooperate with the investigation and abide by any conditions that this Hon"}

data: {"text":"'ble Court may deem fit to impose.\n\n7. That the Applicant has been fully cooperating with the investigating authorities and has not hampered the investigation in any manner. He is"}

data: {"text":" prepared to make himself available as and when required by the investigating officer"}

data: {"text":".\n\n8. That the investigation is pending and there is no likelihood of the Applicant tampering with evidence or influencing witnesses"}

data: {"text":" if released on bail. The continued custody of the Applicant serves no useful purpose and amounts to pre"}

data: {"text":"-trial punishment.\n\n9. That the Applicant undertakes to abide by all conditions that may be imposed by this Hon'ble Court and guarant"}

data: {"text":"ees his presence before the trial court as and when required during the pendency of the trial"}

data: {"text":".\n\n10. That in view of the false implication, lack of criminal antecedents, absence of flight risk, and the"}

data: {"text":" Applicant's willingness to cooperate with the investigation, the interests of justice would be best served by granting bail to the Applicant."}

